      "project": "e:/Programming-related Engineering Project/超级上下文",
      "title": "## Primary Request and Intent - Original: build a DSH-native context-management …",
      "abstract": "## Primary Request and Intent - Original: build a DSH-native context-management plugin (\"Context Flow Tower\") that compiles compaction summaries into a searchable, project-local dictionary (project/module/feature/task/time + narrative chapter/person), with verbatim citations and typed relations. - Must become the real DSH context/compaction path; storage user-selectable (default current project). - Injection must prioritize narrative/progress/change log: “注入的上下文应该包含的信息是每一步说了啥 代码或者文件有何改动 项目进度如何 不是多少多少条 … 要让大模型时刻了解项目全貌 项目进度 改动日志”. - Latest turns: - “B方案，另外 @design\\flow-tower\\21-综合对比-v0.65.md 现存问题也要处理 多agent的适配也要做好 这多agent的适配是大势所趋 我们不能逆势而行” - “现在还有哪些严重的遗留问题” - “/compact语义召回问题现在如何？想想咋处理 再就是咱们小前端 搜索功能不好用” — the leading `/compact` did not execute as a command (see Pending Jobs); semantic recall + panel search are the active asks. ## Key Technical Concepts - DSH 0.2.2-rc.3, preset `cordis`, compaction-basic, FlowTowerCompactionEngine extends BasicCompactionEngine (only overrides `summarize()`), `/compact` via command-compact. - Context sources: native short-range `<compacted-summary>` checkpoint (8 sections) vs Flow Tower long-range digest/Project map. - Injection modes: `dual`, `dual-lit…",
